<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "システム音\The_Lampe.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>Thank you for your hard work, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama. You have reached the third ending of the True Jusatsu Arc.<PG>
Many mysteries were solved in this scenario, were they not?<PG>
The Megasawa City case was a murder case that took place in order to cure Chigaya Niimura's green eyes, and it was necessary to test whether falsificaso was harmless to the human body.<PG>
The curses I was <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="ふけ">absorbed in</STYLE> as a child, and my mother's resolve as well, were all being used.<PG>
But it is strange... When my mother explained to the Kogori couple how to use Droga, it seems to me she did not mention falsificaso...<PG>
Well, perhaps this too will become clear later. Let us go on to the next scenario.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
